      <activity id="bccef224-771c-51bf-8756-304ec7011ae5" activityNameId="a718f183-0cf4-58ed-b50e-0e7fda5d469c" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">xxx Solar system, flat plate collector, one-family house, combined system</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: xxx Solar system, flat plate collector, one-family house, combined system
Solar system with a flat plate collector on a one family house with a combined system for hot water and heating;
UUID: 7370770a-08f4-387d-a70a-0581fe66f050
Production and disposal of a complete solar system (excluding auxiliary heating). Including different components, heat exchange fluid, installation copper pipes, transports of parts to CH, delivery with a van and montage on the roof.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: Solar collector system for room heating and hot water installed on the roof of a house.
Time period: Material data have been investigated for a collector produced in 2002. Data for energy uses during production have been investigated for 2001.
Production volume: 498 systems were sold in CH in 2001
Sampling: Own simulation. 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_7370770a-08f4-387d-a70a-0581fe66f050.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
